<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/7/eng@/~cl_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Paragraph 27(7)(a) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “sections 17, 19 and 20” the words “sections 17, 19, 20, 20c and 20d”. Amendment of Part VII"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/7/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/7/eng@/~cl_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/7/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/7/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/7/eng@/~cl_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/7/eng@> .
